docs/evidence/media-loading/native-review-final.log:1009:  On a normal visit where the technology viewer is never opened, this effect fetches and decodes four large PNGs after `window.load`—about 18 MB of image files. That adds substantial network and memory work to the landing page without making its first viewport useful. Preload only when the viewer is likely to be used, or limit background warming to the first slide. The project's [performance rule](AGENTS.md#L37) explicitly prioritizes a quickly useful first viewport.
